9%2C%20%2Fbyte%20resource%20limit%2F%29%3B%0A%20%20assert.throws%28%28%29%20%3D%3E%20encodeLinkNetworkBinary%28decodeLinkNetworkBinary%28bytes%29%2C%20%7B%20recordLimit%3A%201%20%7D%29%2C%20%2Frecord%20resource%20limit%2F%29%3B%0A%20%20assert.throws%28%28%29%20%3D%3E%20decodeLinkNetworkBinary%28%5B77%2C%2076%2C%2068%2C%2083%2C%2078%2C%2080%2C%2048%2C%2050%2C%20256%5D%29%2C%20BinaryLinksError%29%3B%0A%7D%29%3B%0A%0Atest%28%27both%20shared%20schemas%20agree%20and%20the%20complete%20portable%20framing%20source%20is%20admitted%20by%20the%20checked%20translator%27%2C%20async%20%28%29%20%3D%3E%20%7B%0A%20%20assert.equal%28readFileSync%28new%20URL%28%27..%2Fsrc%2Fdata%2Flink-network-binary-schema.lino%27%2C%20import.meta.url%29%2C%20%27utf8%27%29%2C%0A%20%20%20%20readFileSync%28new%20URL%28%27..%2F..%2Frust%2Fsrc%2Fdata%2Flink-network-binary-schema.lino%27%2C%20import.meta.url%29%2C%20%27utf8%27%29%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20%7B%20parseJavaScript%20%7D%20%3D%20await%20import%28%27..%2Fsrc%2Ftranslation%2Fjavascript.js%27%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20%7B%20checkProgram%20%7D%20%3D%20await%20import%28%27..%2Fsrc%2Ftranslation%2Fcheck.js%27%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20source%20%3D%20readFileSync%28new%20URL%28%27..%2Fsrc%2Flink-network-binary-rules.js%27%2C%20import.meta.url%29%2C%20%27utf8%27%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20program%20%3D%20checkProgram%28parseJavaScript%28source%2C%20%7B%20referenceSemantics%3A%20false%20%7D%29%29%3B%0A%20%20assert.ok%28program.items.length%20%3E%3D%208%29%3B%0A%20%20assert.equal%28transcodeLinkNetworkBinary%28%5B%5D%2C%20true%2C%201%2C%2032%29.startsWith%28%27-3%2C%27%29%2C%20true%29%3B%0A%7D%29%3B%0A%0Afunction%20createBinaryIdentityControl%28version%2Cidentities%29%7B%0A%20const%20record%3Didentity%3D%3E%5Bidentity%2C0%2C1%2C0%2C0%2C0%2C0%2C0%2C0%2C0%2C0%2C0%5D%3B%0A%20return%20%5Bversion%2C...%28version%3D%3D%3D2%3F%5B1000%5D%3A%5B%5D%29%2Cidentities.length%2C...identities.flatMap%28record%29%2C...%28version%3D%3D%3D2%3F%5B0%2C0%5D%3A%5B%5D%29%5D%3B%0A%7D%0Afunctio